    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d681">

                <pb facs="0662" n="496" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg496"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Swenson to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1901-10-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 23, 1901</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>A quarter million dollars more would not satisfy Danish Government. Convention
                    will not be concluded without concessions on points difference and an increase
                    of compensation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Swenson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
